# MAP file version [Apr 2021]

# SIRAH force field
# Coarse grained model for glycans:
# Garay et al. (2020)

# The mapping follows the GLYCAM nomenclature syntax [http://glycam.org/docs/forcefield/glycam-naming-2]
# This convention is very important to avoid ambiguities in setting residue connectivities.
# Atom names in CHARMM format are also supported to allow renaming of residues to GLYCAM names.

# ***** a-L-Fucp for bonds 1-6 b-D-GlcNAc
> CGRES
  CGNAME   Af0
  ALLNAME  FUC 0fA
  MAP O4  O4h     => GO4
  MAP HO4 H4o H4O => GHo4
  MAP O3  O3h     => GO3
  MAP HO3 H3o H3O => GHo3
  MAP C6          => GC6
  MAP O2  O2h     => GO2
  MAP HO2 H2o H2O => GHo2

# ***** a-D-Manp [1-X]
